{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-management","title":"评估成本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agentic-evaluation-methodology/statistics-pitfalls/cost-management","wordCount":1745,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"评估成本管理\">评估成本管理</h1><p>一套评测设施的命运往往不取决于技术上限，而取决于账单曲线：贵到只能月度跑一次的门禁拦不住任何退化，便宜到能随每次提交运行的评测才能真正参与开发节奏。成本管理的目标不是把评测做便宜——而是把每一块钱花在信息含量最高的地方，让「全量重跑」成为日常动作而非董事会决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-先看清楚账单的形状\">核心概念：先看清楚账单的形状</h2><p>评测总成本由四块拼成，性质完全不同。<strong>模型调用费</strong>是最大头也是弹性最大的：被测 agent 的推理开销加上裁判模型的打分开销。Anthropic 公布的运营数据给出了 agentic 场景的量级感——agent 交互的 token 约为普通聊天的 4 倍，多智能体系统约为聊天的 15 倍（Anthropic 工程博客，<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/built-multi-agent-research-system\">built-multi-agent-research-system</a>），把这个倍数乘上任务数和重复次数，就知道为什么评测一跑就是几百万 token。<strong>环境算力费</strong>是第二块：容器运行时长的总和，长程任务动辄几十分钟的单任务时长在这里迅速变现成云账单。剩下两块常被无视：<strong>工程人力</strong>（造任务、修环境、审轨迹）和<strong>等待的机会成本</strong>——开发者盯着门禁排队的时间也是真金白银。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>总</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>task</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>agent</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>tok</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>agent 调用</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>judge</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>tok</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>裁判</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>env</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>wall</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>算力</mtext></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>人力</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>等待</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{总}} = N_{\\text{task}} \\cdot k \\cdot (\\underbrace{t_{\\text{agent}} \\cdot p_{\\text{tok}}}_{\\text{agent 调用}} + \\underbrace{t_{\\text{judge}} \\cdot p_{\\text{tok}}}_{\\text{裁判}} + \\underbrace{c_{\\text{env}} \\cdot T_{\\text{wall}}}_{\\text{算力}}) + C_{\\text{人力}} + C_{\\text{等待}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">task</span></span></span></span></span></span><s